# Remove stale files from retired setups.
#
# .chezmoiremove patterns use the same syntax as .chezmoiignore (target
# paths).  Once the stale file is gone, remove the pattern — it won't
# cause errors if the file is already removed, but it keeps the ignore
# file small.

# Playwright prompts folded into managed agents
# (dot_config/opencode/agents/*.md); these were create_-rendered once, so
# chezmoi removes the leftovers.
.config/opencode/prompts/playwright-test-generator.md
.config/opencode/prompts/playwright-test-healer.md
.config/opencode/prompts/playwright-test-planner.md

# Hand-offs to Caelestia Shell: orphaned host files the adoption commit left
# behind (the retired trees themselves were already purged by the previous
# .chezmoiremove pass — these are the lingering stragglers).
# MIGRATION-ONLY: inert on fresh hosts (files never existed; chezmoi only
# removes files it has managed / that a prior pass left dangling).
.config/chromium-flags.conf
.config/noctalia
.config/systemd/user/dunst.service
.config/systemd/user/graphical-session.target.wants/elephant.service
